    description: `Aristotle defined first principles as the basic propositions that cannot be deduced from anything else. In modern usage — popularized by Elon Musk — it means breaking a problem down to its most fundamental components and rebuilding from there, rather than reasoning by analogy ('what has worked before'). It is harder but more powerful: it can reveal that conventional assumptions are wrong.`,
