    description: `The Apocrypha were books excluded from canonical scripture — authentic-seeming but not authoritative. In everyday use, apocryphal describes stories that circulate as true but lack verification: the Edison-Tesla rivalry stories, many Churchill quotes, the origin of everyday words. Checking whether a compelling story is apocryphal is a basic intellectual hygiene practice.`,
